        "zh-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "cc98d204-d347-3c1e-a00a-37997ee85f8d",
                "word": "aww",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "26f73581-7ecc-3fe6-9981-a999a4707765",
                        "entry_id": "cc98d204-d347-3c1e-a00a-37997ee85f8d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "aw的加長形式。。"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c088dca2-c803-420d-979f-9662683e0b5a",
                                "sense_id": "26f73581-7ecc-3fe6-9981-a999a4707765",
                                "text": "Aww, that's so sad: he hasn't yet learned to ride a bike.",
                                "translation": "哎呀，真可惜：他还没学会骑自行车。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9cf85aa8-5f7b-4e7f-a0df-1edf877b6126",
                                "sense_id": "26f73581-7ecc-3fe6-9981-a999a4707765",
                                "text": "Aww, look at the kitten curled up in her lap!",
                                "translation": "哇，看那只蜷缩在她腿上的小猫！"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b7c8876-bd5a-447d-af51-898f9207e393",
                                "sense_id": "26f73581-7ecc-3fe6-9981-a999a4707765",
                                "text": "THE BELL MAN. (Sits on the bed and bounches up and down.) Awwww, Great Gawd-a-mighty!",
                                "translation": "门童：（坐在床上上下弹跳。） 啊啊啊，我的天哪！"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0141e6bb-496a-4065-9644-51913ef0daa1",
                                "sense_id": "26f73581-7ecc-3fe6-9981-a999a4707765",
                                "text": "&quotSanta Paws is always willing to hear Christmas wishes.\" He winked at Eva as Savannah buried her head under Eva's arm. \"Aww, don't be afraid, sweetie. He won't bite.\" \"Unless you're a cookie.\" […]",
                                "translation": "“圣诞老人爪子总是乐于倾听圣诞愿望。”他朝伊娃眨了眨眼，萨凡纳把头埋在伊娃的胳膊下。“哎呀，别害怕，宝贝。他不会咬人的。”“除非你是块饼干。” […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2eff048a-3799-4b00-a6d3-987b3e74e07b",
                                "sense_id": "26f73581-7ecc-3fe6-9981-a999a4707765",
                                "text": "And like so many robots, they’re an incongruent mashup of terrifying and cute. Aww, look at those guys. Also, runnnnn!",
                                "translation": "和很多机器人一样，它们既吓人又可爱，这种反差令人难以接受。哎呀，看看这些家伙。还有，快跑！"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45150aaf-eb6f-498e-a678-fa67d65b75e5",
                                "sense_id": "26f73581-7ecc-3fe6-9981-a999a4707765",
                                "text": "She slid the goody out into her hand and gave a little aww. He'd baked her a dark chocolate cookie with a white heart swirled on the top. “You are so sweet. I'm going to save this for later, when I need a little pick-me-up, ...",
                                "translation": "她把点心从手里抽出来，轻轻地“哇”了一声。他给她烤了一块黑巧克力饼干，上面画着一颗白色的心形。“你真贴心。我要把它留着，等我需要提提神的时候再吃……”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b33c24e-ca28-4af2-b6b8-bf83f4df45d4",
                                "sense_id": "26f73581-7ecc-3fe6-9981-a999a4707765",
                                "text": "OK, I've actually only tried to ever read one. It was so sweet and puppy-lovey that I was like, \"Aww, I wanted to read some sauciness!\"",
                                "translation": "好吧，其实我只试着读过一本。它太甜腻了，充满了青涩的爱情，我当时就想：“哎呀，我本来想读点劲爆的！”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
